{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","安丹德拉"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名英勇的坦克，能够在作战的同时持续守护一名队友。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我为守护而来。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","I come to protect."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","坚持锻炼就会得到成长。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Keep training to keep growing."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","寓攻于守！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Good defense! And offense!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","还没到放弃的时候……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I can't... give up... now."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","欢呼吧，这是我们的胜利！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","This is our victory!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","为守护而进攻！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","我是安丹德拉，一个被流放者。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","为了守护大家，想试试吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","你说这个，是收到的小礼物，很不错吧？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这正是我喜欢的，谢谢你。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","送我的吗……让你破费了。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","流放之矛"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","为自己的信仰而战，不问代价与归处。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","金戈之舞"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","金戈映日，裙摆翻飞，足尖叩响自由与热情的战歌。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","幻化商店购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","最近过得如何？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","家乡现在如何了呢……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要尝尝我烤的兔子吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","变得更温馨了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节要一起过吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真是温暖又热闹啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","一起去外面走走吧？"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉臂力过人，扳手腕很少输，即使对面是健壮的男性也一样。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","据说，安丹德拉身上的金饰比旁人的沉重一些，是由前几任首席战士的遗物熔炼而成的。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","据说，安丹德拉在玩剪刀石头布时，每次都会先出石头。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","据萨忒娜说，过去安丹德拉虽身为神庙战士，却不信占卜。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“在雇我们照顾孩子时，她出手可是相当阔绰。”赏金猎人们都很好奇安丹德拉从哪里变出那么多钱。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉狩猎技术十分优秀，能猎取比自己大上数倍的野兽而毫发无伤。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","据说安丹德拉的盾之所以如此坚固，是由于神庙的祝福。但被流放后的安丹德拉，依然可以毫不费力地抵御敌人的进攻。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉重视每一日的磨炼，对身边的孩童亦是如此要求，但她严格而不乏慈爱，所以仍然很受孩子们喜欢。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","在萨忒娜的记忆中，安丹德拉总是温柔地笑着，她总是不能将传闻中那个强悍的战士和自己温柔体贴的好友联系起来。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉没有自己的孩子，但是有很多孩子将其视为母亲。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","卡卡，看起来帕托和你相处很好呢，它凶不凶？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412070.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 卡卡 & 安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","我的过去……你会对这些感兴趣吗？<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>？"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412080.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","索恩，坐下好好休息吧，已经走了一天，应该很疲劳了。"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412120.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉 & 索恩 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","安丹德拉为什么在休息时经常闭上眼睛？好像也没在睡觉……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412160.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","最近过得如何？"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415088.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","要尝尝我烤的兔子吗？"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415089.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","变得更温馨了"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415397.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节要一起过吗？"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415398.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","真是温暖又热闹啊"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415569.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","一起去外面走走吧？"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415570.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉"]]}